itespace) don't get displayed.\n\nIn the MRP I've attacked this script to a Label node:\n\n```\nextends Label\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\ttext = \"❄️1234567890 why do the numbers between the emoji and this sentence not show up?\\n🔥123 these work\\n💦123 these too\\n❄️123 but not these?\"\n```\n\nAnd the result when you run the project is:\n\n<img width=\"433\" height=\"136\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f2e0555-a2e0-4f0b-a466-45eae4d91309\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPaste \"❄️1234567890\" in a label node. Notice that none of the numbers show up.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[label-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23419178/label-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112510/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112510/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_co